@startuml sd_us105
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US105 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftController" as AircraftController
participant "UpdateAircraftUseCase" as UpdateAircraftUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== PATCH /api/aircrafts/{registration} ==
Actor -> EAM : PATCH /api/aircrafts/{registration}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftController -> UpdateAircraftUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateAircraftUseCase -> DBAM : find aircraft
alt held by this replica
UpdateAircraftUseCase -> DBAM : check version, apply the change\n+ copy for the other holder in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateAircraftUseCase --> AircraftController : updated
AircraftController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/aircrafts\n(to the other holder, retried until delivered)
else not held here
AircraftController -> PAM : same PATCH, X-Peer-Forwarded\n(to the peers one at a time, until a holder answers)
PAM --> AircraftController : 200 from the holder
AircraftController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Data-Node)
note over PAM : the holder copies the change\nto the other holder
end
@enduml
